{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Galois 覆叠"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Galois覆叠"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><strong>Galois 覆叠</strong> (又叫<strong>正则覆叠</strong>) 是覆叠变换群在纤维上有"},{"Local":{"url":"传递作用","text":"传递作用"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"覆叠","text":"覆叠"}},{"Plain":", 等同于变换群 (作为离散群) 的"},{"Local":{"url":"主丛","text":"主丛"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}